# The production builds `COPY . .` and then `yarn install` inside the image, so
# dependencies and build output must come from that install/build, never from the
# host's tree (whose native modules are compiled for a different OS/libc). The
# development containers bind-mount the repo instead of copying it, so this only
# trims their build context.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
